{"lyrics":"[00:00.00] [Instrumental Intro]\n[Chorus]\n[00:14.28] Mm, uh\n[00:14.64] Over and over in a DeLorean\n[00:17.44] I'm turning back to a demon, just call me Dylan\n[00:20.94] Triple-nine spinnin' 'round on my forehead\n[00:24.50] One minute it's 9, next minute, 6's (6's)\n[00:27.06] I blame it on the drugs and the success (Success)\n[00:31.50] I blame it on the witches and the fishnets (Fishnets)\n[00:35.06] I blame it on the Devil in my conscience (Devil in my conscience)\n[00:37.70] Rebel, heavy metal, demons playing my guitar riffs (Guitar riffs)\n[Verse 1]\n[00:41.78] It's 2:25 in the morning\n[00:44.56] Lookin' in the mirror, Percs killing all my torment (Okay)\n[00:48.18] 4:25 in the morning\n[00:51.46] Amsterdam 'shrooms got me up in Hell roamin' (Okay)\n[00:55.10] Uh, looking at myself from below\n[00:57.82] Body sittin' on the bed, spirit underneath the floor\n[01:01.68] Heart out in space, and it's gettin' kinda cold\n[01:04.68] Feel like I don't got no space, so I gotta leave home\n[01:09.04] In a different realm, roaming in my skull\n[01:11.30] Woke up with Devil horns in my head, losing all control\n[01:14.66] I look back in the mirror to see what's goin' on\n[01:17.76] It's all become clear, Juice WRLD is gone\n[Chorus]\n[01:23.04] Uh, over and over in a DeLorean (Skrtt, skrtt)\n[01:25.78] I'm turning back to a demon, just call me Dylan (Skrtt)\n[01:29.52] Triple-9 spinnin' 'round on my forehead\n[01:33.08] One minute it's 9, next minute, 6's (6's)\n[01:35.84] I blame it on the drugs and the success (Success)\n[01:39.92] I blame it on the witches and the fishnets (Fishnets)\n[01:42.68] I blame it on the Devil in my conscience (Devil in my conscience)\n[01:46.30] Rebel, heavy metal, demons playing my guitar riffs (Guitar riffs)\n[Verse 2]\n[01:50.22] I'ma do what I'm best at, I guess\n[01:53.30] Try to change the world off the drugs, it's a process\n[01:56.76] Oh, I'ma ball 'til I fall, baby, all day\n[01:59.26] Been through it all, baby, livin' in Hell, that is what you call it\n[02:02.96] Don't call my phone right now, going insane\n[02:07.08] All alone right now when I'm stuck in my brain\n[02:10.76] With a room full of people, still feels the same\n[02:14.10] White M's, A-215s make me feel okay\n[02:17.54] The Devil's set up shop, he been pumpin' shit in my veins\n[02:20.86] I need another doc', pray that Dr. God is on the way\n[02:24.38] Satan wrote me a prescription for them blue pills, ayy\n[02:27.64] A few pills had me too lit, can't be saved\n[Bridge]\n[02:34.54] I need another doc', pray that Dr. God is on the way (Way)\n[02:41.34] A few pills had me too lit, can't be saved\n[Chorus]\n[02:45.66] Uh, over and over in a DeLorean\n[02:48.20] I'm turning back to a demon, just call me Dylan\n[02:51.80] Triple-nine spinnin' 'round on my forehead\n[02:55.36] One minute it's 9, next minute, 6's (6's)\n[02:58.14] I blame it on the drugs and the success (Success)\n[03:02.30] I blame it on the witches and the fishnets (Fishnets)\n[03:05.62] I blame it on the devil in my conscience (Devil in my conscience)\n[03:08.58] Rebel, heavy metal, demons playing my guitar riffs (Guitar riffs)","words":[[3.12,5.12,"[Chorus]"],[14.28,14.34,"Mm,"],[14.5,14.6,"uh"],[14.64,14.96,"Over"],[15.04,15.2,"and"],[15.3,15.62,"over"],[15.72,15.84,"in"],[15.92,15.92,"a"],[16.06,16.88,"DeLorean"],[17.44,17.48,"I'm"],[17.52,17.92,"turning"],[17.98,18.14,"back"],[18.2,18.26,"to"],[18.46,18.46,"a"],[18.62,18.98,"demon,"],[19.04,19.2,"just"],[19.26,19.4,"call"],[19.48,19.56,"me"],[19.68,20.06,"Dylan"],[20.94,21.56,"Triple-nine"],[21.78,22.16,"spinnin'"],[22.2,22.64,"'round"],[22.76,22.8,"on"],[22.86,22.94,"my"],[23.1,23.92,"forehead"],[24.5,24.76,"One"],[24.82,25.1,"minute"],[25.2,25.4,"it's"],[25.42,25.64,"9,"],[25.92,26.1,"next"],[26.16,26.64,"minute,"],[26.86,26.96,"6's"],[26.98,27.02,"(6's)"],[27.06,27.06,"I"],[28.24,28.52,"blame"],[28.58,28.7,"it"],[28.78,28.86,"on"],[28.9,28.94,"the"],[29.06,29.56,"drugs"],[29.64,29.7,"and"],[29.7